t<br /> But I think Lady Constancia of Erciyes and Unre are two different person<br /> Children of the Night states that Unre spent nearly two centuries beyond the Shroud, and while it is possible she entered the Shadowlands long after the Feast of Folly, Constancia was active and only vanishes from sight in 1443 (right befire the Giovanni purge started) and Anatole met Constancia in a ramshackle hut in the Egyptian desert around 1882<br /> An unmarked tomb was found in 1936 near Giza, containing a desiccated corpse (conveniently, one of the Mortis powers is to reduce oneself into the form of a desiccated corpse) may or my not been her, but the body disappeared before anyone, especially the Giovanni could investigate<br /> Math refuse mathing in this case<br /> <br /> And it is strongly implied <b>Troglodytia, </b>the Queen Mother sired the Baron (it the Samedi is not a Drowned Legacy) and that would make her a 4th generation Child of Cappadocius - but it is just an implication given her apperance and behavior and very short story we know about her","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","user":"Shadeprowler","date":". 11-02-2025, 01:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-03T06:08:45-08:00","id":1555019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadeprowler</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1554876-timeline-of-vampire-the-masquerade?p=1554972#post1554972\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pretty neat<br /> But I think Lady Constancia of Erciyes and Unre are two different person<br /> Children of the Night states that Unre spent nearly two centuries beyond the Shroud, and while it is possible she entered the Shadowlands long after the Feast of Folly, Constancia was active and only vanishes from sight in 1443 (right befire the Giovanni purge started) and Anatole met Constancia in a ramshackle hut in the Egyptian desert around 1882<br /> An unmarked tomb was found in 1936 near Giza, containing a desiccated corpse (conveniently, one of the Mortis powers is to reduce oneself into the form of a desiccated corpse) may or my not been her, but the body disappeared before anyone, especially the Giovanni could investigate<br /> Math refuse mathing in this case<br /> <br /> And it is strongly implied <b>Troglodytia, </b>the Queen Mother sired the Baron (it the Samedi is not a Drowned Legacy) and that would make her a 4th generation Child of Cappadocius - but it is just an implication given her apperance and behavior and very short story we know about her</div> </div> </div> </div>When Unre came out on Children of the Night I believe the intention was to be Constancia post Cappadocius diablerie. Her headlining on DA novel came later and that changes this intention.<br /> <br /> About the Drowned Legacies I won't even go there, as a south american i dislike to say that they are pretty offensive to me.<br /> <br /> - Saga<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"