img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-nosferatu.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-nosferatu.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-nosferatu.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-09T10:27:07-08:00","id":1555272,"title":"","content":"Nagaraja and Ravnos are up.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-nagaraja.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/1...-nagaraja.html</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-ravnos.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/1...gy-ravnos.html</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-ravnos.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/1...ee-ravnos.html</a><br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-09T21:05:36-08:00","id":1555303,"title":"","content":"Toreador are up.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-toreador.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/1...-toreador.html</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-toreador.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/1...-toreador.html</a><br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-09T23:40:13-08:00","id":1555304,"title":"","content":"<b>Namrael, the Enochian</b>/Namrael the Enochite I always tought was the member of the 2nd Generation - one of the obscure ones, like The First Born\u200b, Amirat, the Crone or Aretstikapha<br /> She was described as a daughter of Caine who left &quot;the undead city of her sire&quot; in the time of the First City to join what became the Midnight Circus - now this could be interpret in many ways, a female cainite as the &quot;Daughter of Caine&quot;, in the metaphorical sense, or she was a mortal daughter of Caine or Embraced by Caine<br /> I know it is your interpretation, you told us, you fill the gaps and puzzled together what you could but out of curiosity ,why put her in the Toreador family tree?<br /> <br /> (Speaking of Toreadors, I firmly belive <b>Arikel, the Sculptor</b>\u200b and <b>Ishtar, the Bull-dancer</b>\u200b are two seperate entities - in thta topic I made a little essay back then<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1511164-arikel#post1511195\">https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/...el#post1511195</a> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23890-shadeprowler","name":"Shadeprowler","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23890_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-10T13:25:47-08:00","id":1555328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MalleusXXIII</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1554876-timeline-of-vampire-the-masquerade?p=1555060#post1555060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can I ask the source of Elyon, childe of Adonai? I only ask as I can't find a reference for it anywhere, and I play a Salubri antitribu grandchilde of Adonai named Elyon...</div> </div> </div> </div>Found it, took me a while. Elyon was an NPC I used a while ago for chronicle set in LA (a bit changed from canon since it become Camarilla during gameplay):<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Sabbat diplomats reveal themselves</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Time:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- 00:00</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">PCs:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- Ahmad</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">NPCs:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- Eleanor de Valois</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- Victoria</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- Elyon</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- Murad</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Places:</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">- LA County Museum of Art [elysium]</span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">A suspicious presence alerted Sheriff Ahmad coming from Torrance. This lead to the LA Museum of Art where they stopped their car (an expensive one). If investigated, their paperwork leads to a TelMex subsidiary in LA. They simply wait at the entrance of the hotel until Eleanor comes. They present themselves as who they are, diplomats from the Sabbat. They claim that they'll stay at Hotel Wilshire and they request to meet with the Prince or similar authority at elysium in order to discuss the advancement of the kueijin. The Sabbat refuse to meet at the Austin Palace II, claiming that the presence of Mme. Guil or any of her entourage would prove to be disastrous to their proposition and they'll like to keep this particular meeting in secret from Mme. Guil or any of her entourage.</span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:10px\"><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">Elyon</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\">8th generation, childe of Adonai</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Clan:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Salubri antitribu</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Nature:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Fanatic</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Demeanor:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Soldier</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Embrace:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> 1764</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Apparent Age:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> late 20s or late 40s</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Attributes:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Strength 5, Dexterity 4, Stamina 5, Appearance 2, Perception 3, Intelligence 3, Wits 4</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Abilities:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Alertness 4, Brawl 3, Intimidation 3, Melee 5, Linguistics (english, hebrew, latin, spanish) 3</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Disciplines:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Auspex 5, Fortitude 4, Potence 2, Valeren 5</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Morality:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Path of Honorable Accord 6</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Willpower:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> 7</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"><b>Image:</b></span><span style=\"font-family:Times New Roman\"> Bald with wrinkles in his forehead, no facial hair at all. His appearance place him to be from early 20s up to late 40s. Carries his sword in a cardboard box. He has several tattoos in his right arm (enochian scriptures of the Book of Nod).</span></span><br /> <br /> \u200b- Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-11T12:17:42-08:00","id":1555367,"title":"","content":"Tremere are up.<br /> <br /> Btw, started to put in italics those created by me on the family trees to avoid confusion.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/genealogy-tremere.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-tremere.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://saga1982.blogspot.com/2025/11/family-tree-tremere.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> - Saga","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1594-saga","name":"Saga","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-11-11T16:58:13-08:00","id":1555380,"title":""